#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Critical concepts: {#critical-concepts}"
msgstr "Konsep-konsep kritis: {#critical-concepts}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are uncertainty relations between many sets of physical observables, including position & linear momentum, and components of spin.\n"
msgstr "Ada relasi ketidakpastian antara banyak pasang observabel fisik, termasuk posisi & momentum linear, dan komponen spin.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli matrices do not commute. This is a mathematical reflection of the fact that not all components of spin can be simultaneously known/determined.\n"
msgstr "Matriks Pauli tidak komutatif. Ini adalah cerminan matematis dari fakta bahwa tidak semua komponen spin dapat diketahui/ditentukan secara bersamaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computing makes heavy use of the Pauli operators/matrices, so it is useful to know the uncertainty relation for Pauli operators, as well as the closely-related spin operators.\n"
msgstr "Komputasi kuantum banyak menggunakan operator/matriks Pauli, sehingga berguna untuk mengetahui relasi ketidakpastian untuk operator Pauli, serta operator spin yang berkaitan erat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A general formula for the uncertainty of two operators $A$ and $B$ is $$\\Delta A \\Delta B \\geq \\frac{1}{2}|\\langle [A,B] \\rangle|.$$\n"
msgstr "Rumus umum untuk ketidakpastian dua operator $A$ dan $B$ adalah $$\\Delta A \\Delta B \\geq \\frac{1}{2}|\\langle [A,B] \\rangle|.$$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An eigenstate $|a\\rangle$ of some operator $A$ yields zero uncertainty in the physical observable associated with that operator. Even experimentally, $\\Delta A \\approx 0.$\n"
msgstr "Eigenstate $|a\\rangle$ dari suatu operator $A$ menghasilkan ketidakpastian nol pada observabel fisik yang terkait dengan operator tersebut. Bahkan secara eksperimental, $\\Delta A \\approx 0.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An eigenstate $|a\\rangle$ of some operator $A$ will yield a larger uncertainty for an operator $B$ that does not commute with $A$.\n"
msgstr "Eigenstate $|a\\rangle$ dari suatu operator $A$ akan menghasilkan ketidakpastian yang lebih besar untuk operator $B$ yang tidak komutatif dengan $A$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Experimental results using a real quantum computer confirm the intuition we gain from matrix representations of physical operators.\n"
msgstr "Hasil eksperimen menggunakan komputer kuantum nyata mengkonfirmasi intuisi yang kita peroleh dari representasi matriks operator fisik.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Questions: {#tf-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan B/S: {#tf-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F One can simultaneously measure $X$ and $Y$, but not $Z$.\n"
msgstr "B/S Seseorang bisa mengukur $X$ dan $Y$ secara bersamaan, tapi tidak $Z$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F One can simultaneously measure $X$ and $Z$, but not $Y$.\n"
msgstr "B/S Seseorang bisa mengukur $X$ dan $Z$ secara bersamaan, tapi tidak $Y$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Linear position and linear momentum operators do not commute.\n"
msgstr "B/S Operator posisi linear dan momentum linear tidak komutatif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F IBM quantum computers measure along $Z$ by default, so a rotation must be performed to measure along any other direction.\n"
msgstr "B/S Komputer kuantum IBM mengukur sepanjang $Z$ secara default, sehingga rotasi harus dilakukan untuk mengukur sepanjang arah lain.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F The circuit below effectively measures $Z$ and then $X$.\n"
msgstr "B/S Circuit di bawah ini secara efektif mengukur $Z$ lalu $X$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A circuit diagram showing a measurement, a Hadamard gate, and then another measurement.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/exploring-uncertainty-with-qiskit/tf-q5.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A circuit diagram showing a measurement, a Hadamard gate, and then another measurement.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/exploring-uncertainty-with-qiskit/tf-q5.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "MC Questions: {#mc-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan Pilihan Ganda: {#mc-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The diagram below demonstrates which of the following uncertainty relations?\n"
msgstr "Diagram di bawah ini menunjukkan relasi ketidakpastian yang mana dari berikut ini?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $\\Delta X \\Delta Y \\geq |\\langle Z \\rangle|$\n"
msgstr "a. $\\Delta X \\Delta Y \\geq |\\langle Z \\rangle|$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\Delta Y \\Delta Z \\geq |\\langle X \\rangle|$\n"
